oStyle249_2_94ca4083-a2ec-4c74-a62b-0551047aab87.jpg?v=1778142933', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0932/5569/6681/files/TheNoStyle249Beige281_137bd138-6542-4395-b9b3-5211bc85dacf.jpg?v=1778034602', 'Cotton', 'Áo Polo Boxy Hack Dáng Che Bụng CloudTouch™ Cổ Áo Bản Lớn Cá Tính The No Style 249 Beige 28 Dáng Hộp F5', 377150.0, 100, 4.5, 'ACTIVE', 'Cai', '2026-05-21 11:40:31', 1);
